SUMMARY:FirstCheck 201: Smart Angels Do Smart Deals (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/gn2md6vu​ \nThis is where you stop learning about investing and start operating like a Smart Angel Investor. You’ll learn how disciplined investors evaluate opportunities and begin making your own invest-or-pass decisions. After this course\, you’ll have structured evaluation criteria\, the ability to justify a decision\, and the beginning of an investor’s discipline. \nThis session is ideal for the following investment related stakeholders: \n-Prospective Angel Investors who want to learn more about the world of Angel Investing\n-Investment Advisors (RIA/FA) who are looking for alternative investments for their clients\n-Entrepreneurs who want to learn more about what Angels are looking for in their deals\n-Entrepreneurs who want to meet/network with Angel Investors
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/firstcheck-201-smart-angels-do-smart-deals-online/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Course-Banner-3.png?ver=1785278710
END:VEVENT
