SUMMARY:Pickle Lab’s Two Year Anniversary Celebration
DESCRIPTION:We’re celebrating 2 years of serves\, smashes\, and community at Pickle Lab\, and you’re invited to join the fun!\n\nSwing by on Thursday\, August 20 from 6 – 9 PM for an evening of open play pickleball (paddles are available to borrow)\, beats by a live DJ\, MADabolic demonstrations\, a variety of giveaways and swag\, and complimentary samples from White Claw Zero. Enjoy a free beverage courtesy of Second Draught\, and food will be available for purchase from local food truck\, Crunchy’s for the Munchies.\n\nThis event is free to attend\, but RSVPs are encouraged.
